Package: com.wjf.pin120
Name: Pin120
Version: 2.2.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Keeps ProMotion pinned at 120Hz in games on iPad Pro (2018/A12X). Forces UIScreen.maximumFramesPerSecond, CADisplayLink and Unity targetFrameRate to 120, and re-pins every display link once per second. In-game HUD (top-left, expanded 5s at launch) shows live refresh rate, thermal state, engine request and re-pin count.
Maintainer: wjf
Author: wjf
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0)
